      "side": 1,
      "message": "Not sure if I follow.\n\nOn rev0, EMMC_CMD is on B15 only. SPI1_NSS on A15 only.\nOn rev1, EMMC_CMD in on B15 and A14, SPI1_NSS on A15 only.\n\nOn rev1, we want EMMC_CMD on A14 (RO only), and SPI1_NSS on A15 (RO+RW).\n\nOn rev0, yes, we could have SPI1_NSS interrupts in RW only, but we\u0027ll deprecate rev0 soon anyway, so I don\u0027t feel it\u0027s really useful... UNIMPLEMENTED(SPI1_NSS) would also work, but we might as well use the real GPIO, since we have it...",
